  "description": "Bowire-agent catalogue provider — sources the workbench's URL/service catalogue from a Bowire Agent hub (#128). When an embedded Bowire instance registers with a central hub, the hub itself becomes a catalogue source: every registered agent's discoverable services surface in the hub's workbench UI under the IBowireCatalogueProvider seam (#136 / #305). Ships standalone so installs that don't run a Bowire Agent hub don't pay any transitive weight.",
